SCORE: 10
REASON:  The provided text fully supports the fact. It explicitly states that the EU allocated more than €1.3 billion between 2014 and 2020 to address ASF outbreaks, including compensation for farmers and control measures. This matches the fact in both the amount of money, the time period, and the purpose of the funding. Therefore, the text provides complete justification for the fact.

FACT: ASF outbreaks in Vietnam in 2019 led to the culling of over 6 million pigs, accounting for 20% of the country's pig population, severely impacting local farmers.   [5]
