SCORE: 10
REASON:  The provided text fully supports the fact. Both statements highlight that live attenuated vaccines have shown promise or efficacy in experimental settings but are limited in widespread use due to safety concerns and the risk of reversion to virulence. The wording and meaning in both texts are nearly identical, making the provided text a complete justification for the fact.

